{"case_id": "q061-batch", "row_id": "q061", "mode": "batch", "objective": "FG-3149 sponsor development stage indication public source", "query": ["FG-3149 sponsor development stage", "FG-3149 Crohn's disease", "FG-3149 FibroGen clinical development"], "anchors": ["FG-3149"], "search_latency_ms": 553.6, "target": "FG-3149", "ok": true, "error": null, "jev_latency_ms": 389.1, "calls": 10, "attempts": 10, "usage": {"input_tokens": 7647, "output_tokens": 360}, "cost_usd": 0.000321, "n_candidates": 10, "n_kept": 2, "abstain": false, "top_score": 0.6776, "results": [{"rank": 10, "query_index": null, "title": "Efficacy and safety of filgotinib as induction and maintenance therapy for Crohn's disease (DIVERSITY): a phase 3, double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled trial", "url": "https://www.thelancet.com/journals/langas/article/PIIS2468-1253(24)00272-3/fulltext", "domain": "thelancet.com", "snippet": "The most frequently reported serious TEAE (≥2% of patients in any filgotinib or associated placebo group) was an exacerbation, flare, or worsening of Crohn's disease (appendix p 39).", "date": "2025-02-01", "last_updated": "2025-08-09", "orig_rank": 10, "answers": {"on_target": 0.84, "evidence": 0.8067}, "jev_score": 0.6776, "jev_rank": 1, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 6, "query_index": null, "title": "Our Partners - FibroGen", "url": "https://www.fibrogen.com/our-partners", "domain": "fibrogen.com", "snippet": "FibroGen anticipates the initiation of a Phase II trial in metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer, or mCRPC, in the second half of 2024 with the potential for additional trials targeting other CD46 expressing cancers.", "date": "2016-01-01", "last_updated": "2025-10-12", "orig_rank": 6, "answers": {"on_target": 0.62, "evidence": 0.86}, "jev_score": 0.5332, "jev_rank": 2, "kept": true, "reason": "kept"}, {"rank": 9, "query_index": null, "title": "FibroGen | Drug Developments | Pipeline Prospector", "url": "https://www.pharmacompass.com/pipeline-prospector-drugs-in-development/fibrogen", "domain": "pharmacompass.com", "snippet": "**Study Phase : **\nPreclinical\n**Sponsor : **\nRegeneron Pharmaceuticals", "date": "2025-02-20", "last_updated": "2025-08-28", "orig_rank": 9, "answers": {"on_target": 0.35, "evidence": 0.82}, "jev_score": 0.287, "jev_rank": 3, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 7, "query_index": null, "title": "FibroGen : Corporate Presentation - September 2025", "url": "https://www.marketscreener.com/news/fibrogen-corporate-presentation-september-2025-ce7d58d9db80f422", "domain": "marketscreener.com", "snippet": "Completed sale of FibroGen China to AstraZeneca for approximately $220 million", "date": "2025-09-18", "last_updated": "2025-09-29", "orig_rank": 7, "answers": {"on_target": 0.49, "evidence": 0.0533}, "jev_score": 0.0261, "jev_rank": 4, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 1, "query_index": null, "title": "New weapons for the management of perianal Crohn's disease", "url": "https://oamonitor.ireland.openaire.eu/national/search/publication?pid=10.1016/j.bpg.2025.102030", "domain": "oamonitor.ireland.openaire.eu", "snippet": "Researcher Monitors\n...\nWe’re experiencing a temporary issue.\nPlease\nrefresh the page", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-03-30", "orig_rank": 1, "answers": {"on_target": 0.23, "evidence": 0.0833}, "jev_score": 0.0192, "jev_rank": 5, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 3, "query_index": null, "title": "Kyntra Bio - Wikipedia", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyntra_Bio", "domain": "en.wikipedia.org", "snippet": "By 2026, Kyntra was mainly reduced to a single early-stage oncology drug candidate.\n...\nOver the next few years, multiple late-stage clinical trials across its pipeline failed, leading the company to significantly reduce its workforce in 2023 and 2024.\n...\nFollowing the sale of its Chinese subsidiary, FibroGen is now left primarily with FG-3246, an asset it acquired from Fortis Therapeutics, a defunct biotech company, at no upfront cost with a large milestone due only if the drug advances into Phase 3.\n...\n|Drug / Program|Indication|Phase 3 Trial(s)|Outcome|Notes|\n|--|--|--|--|--|\n|Roxadustat|Anemia in Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD)|ANDES, OLYMPUS, ALPS, ROCKIES, SIERRAS, HIMALAYAS, PYRENEES|FDA rejected August 2021|Company changed prespecified statistical criteria for cardiovascular safety analysis and FDA raised concerns about data integrity|\n|Roxadustat|Anemia in Myelodysplastic Syndromes (MDS)|MATTERHORN|Failed May 2023|Did not meet primary endpoint|\n|Pamrevlumab|Idiopathic Pulmonary Fibrosis (IPF)|ZEPHYRUS-1, ZEPHYRUS-2|Failed June 2023|ZEPHYRUS-1 missed primary endpoint; ZEPHYRUS-2 terminated after interim review|\n|Pamrevlumab|Duchenne Muscular Dystrophy (DMD)|LELANTOS-1, LELANTOS-2|Failed June–August 2023|Both trials failed to meet primary endpoints on motor function|\n...\nAll of its US Phase 3 trials for both roxadustat and pamrevlumab including indications for anemia, Duchenne muscular dystrophy, idiopathic pulmonary fibrosis, and pancreatic cancer ultimately failed or were rejected.\nIn 2025, the only significant remaining asset is FG-3246.\n...\nFibroGen is also developing FG-3180, a PET imaging agent, to help track the cancer and predict responses to FG-3246.\nA Phase 2 trial of FG-3246 began in September 2025, with full completion expected in March 2028.", "date": "2025-09-10", "last_updated": "2026-06-27", "orig_rank": 3, "answers": {"on_target": 0.14, "evidence": 0.0967}, "jev_score": 0.0135, "jev_rank": 6, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 2, "query_index": null, "title": "Serum biomarkers of fibrostenotic Crohn's disease", "url": "https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/pdf/10.1111/1751-2980.12913", "domain": "onlinelibrary.wiley.com", "snippet": "Opens an external website\nOpens an external website in a new window\n...\nReject Non-Essential", "date": "2020-06-01", "last_updated": "2026-09-08", "orig_rank": 2, "answers": {"on_target": 0.09, "evidence": 0.0967}, "jev_score": 0.0087, "jev_rank": 7, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 4, "query_index": null, "title": "FibroGen Inc. (NASDAQ:FGEN) : Ptab Cases :: Law360", "url": "https://www.law360.co.uk/companies/fibrogen-inc/ptab_cases", "domain": "law360.co.uk", "snippet": "## PTAB Cases (74)\n...\net al.\n...\n2. Filed: September 12, 2025 | IPR2025-01531 Apotex Inc.", "date": "2026-10-03", "last_updated": "2026-10-03", "orig_rank": 4, "answers": {"on_target": 0.5, "evidence": 0.0133}, "jev_score": 0.0066, "jev_rank": 8, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 5, "query_index": null, "title": "FibroGen Reports First Quarter 2024 Financial Results", "url": "https://investor.kyntrabio.com/node/13811/pdf", "domain": "investor.kyntrabio.com", "snippet": "FG-3246 (also known as FOR46), a first-in-class antibody-drug conjugate (ADC) targeting CD46 is in development for the treatment of metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-09-15", "orig_rank": 5, "answers": {"on_target": 0.08, "evidence": 0.0633}, "jev_score": 0.0051, "jev_rank": 9, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}, {"rank": 8, "query_index": null, "title": "FibroGen, Inc. (NASDAQ:FGEN) Q1 2024 Earnings Conference Call ...", "url": "https://reportify-1252068037.cos.ap-beijing.myqcloud.com/media/production/s_4689968_a2b4c0ac65184dcf6818814db38a7a6b.pdf", "domain": "reportify-1252068037.cos.ap-beijing.myqcloud.com", "snippet": "Lastly, in April, we announced compelling top line results from our Phase 1 monotherapy study of FG-3246 in patients with metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer.\n...\nFG-3246 is a first-in-class ADC for metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer, colorectal cancer, and other tumor types.\n...\nFG-3246 is comprised of an anti\nCD46 antibody, YS5 linked to an antimitotic agent, MMAE, which is clinically validated and FDA-approved\nADC payload.\n...\nFG-3246 has demonstrated monotherapy clinical efficacy in metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer.\n...\nThe completed Phase 1 trial includes a total of 56 metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer patients who are\n...\nThe radiopharmaceutical biomarker will be part of our Phase 2 dose optimization monotherapy trial sponsored by FibroGen.\n...\nLastly, we are planning a meeting with the FDA in the third quarter to discuss the details of the FG-3246 development program, contingent upon reaching agreement with the FDA on the trial design, we anticipate the initiation of a Phase 2/3 dose optimization and registration-enabling study in metastatic castration-resistant prostate cancer in the fourth quarter of 2024.", "date": null, "last_updated": "2026-06-02", "orig_rank": 8, "answers": {"on_target": 0.04, "evidence": 0.06}, "jev_score": 0.0024, "jev_rank": 10, "kept": false, "reason": "low_on_target"}], "total_ms": 942.7, "ts": "2026-10-06T12:18:17+00:00"}
